'''Boiling Blood''' is a [[debuff]] and [[ground effect]] that deals Physical damage over time. 

Sources:

* {{il|Vaal Reap}}
* {{il|Storm Call of Trarthus}}

Monsters which use this debuff:
*[[Freidrich Tarollo, Slave Merchant]] (also slows the character and stacks up to 10)
*[[Ahuana, Architect of Ceremonies]]
* [[Forged Whipleg]] (from its [[Skill:CGECrucibleBloodGround|CGECrucibleBloodGround]] skill)
